---
export const prerender = true;
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

<title>
  TotalSportek Copyright & Rights Policy | Intellectual Property Information
</title>

<meta
  name="description"
  content="Read the TotalSportek policy covering copyright, intellectual property, ownership questions, rights-holder concerns, notices, and other legal matters relating to content and materials referenced on the website."
/>

<meta
  name="keywords"
  content="TotalSportek copyright, TotalSportek intellectual property, TotalSportek rights, TotalSportek legal policy, TotalSportek copyright information, intellectual property rights, copyright notice, rights holder information, content ownership, copyright request, legal notice, content rights policy"
/>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />

    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-[#09090f]">
    <header class="bg-[#131320] border-b border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f9fafb] hover:text-purple-400 transition whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            TotalSportek
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-10">

<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-[#f9fafb]">
  TotalSportek Copyright & Intellectual Property Policy | Rights, Claims & Notices
</h1>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Our Approach to Copyright
  </h2>

  <p>
    TotalSportek respects the intellectual property of creators, organizations,
    publishers, sports entities, and other rights owners. Copyrighted works,
    trademarks, visual identities, and other protected materials remain under
    the ownership of their respective holders. Anyone with a genuine rights
    concern can provide relevant information so the matter can be properly
    understood and reviewed.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    About TotalSportek Content
  </h2>

  <p>
    TotalSportek serves as a sports information website covering games,
    competitions, teams, leagues, athletes, schedules, fixtures, events,
    and related sports details. References to third-party organizations,
    media, broadcasts, publications, or other protected material do not mean
    that TotalSportek claims ownership of those works or represents the
    original rights holder.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Trademarks & Brand References
  </h2>

  <p>
    Names, logos, team identities, league branding, competition marks,
    symbols, and trademarks displayed in connection with sports information
    remain associated with their respective owners. These references are used
    to identify the relevant teams, leagues, competitions, or events and
    should not be understood as an indication of an official relationship,
    sponsorship, approval, or endorsement by those organizations.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Submitting a Copyright Concern
  </h2>

  <p>
    If you are a copyright owner or authorized representative and believe
    that your protected material requires attention, you may submit a
    detailed request to TotalSportek. Providing accurate information and
    enough context about the reported material helps make the review process
    clearer and more effective.
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
    <li>Name of the copyright owner or authorized agent</li>
    <li>Reliable contact details for communication</li>
    <li>Identification of the copyrighted work involved</li>
    <li>Relevant TotalSportek page or location</li>
    <li>Clear description of the copyright concern</li>
    <li>Information demonstrating ownership or authorization</li>
    <li>Confirmation that the submitted information is truthful and accurate</li>
  </ul>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    How TotalSportek Reviews Requests
  </h2>

  <p>
    Submitted copyright or intellectual property requests may be reviewed
    based on the details, documentation, and circumstances provided. If a
    request does not contain enough information to understand the issue,
    TotalSportek may require additional clarification before determining
    an appropriate response.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Accuracy of Legal Submissions
  </h2>

  <p>
    Copyright notices and rights-related communications should contain
    specific, relevant, and accurate information. Clear descriptions,
    supporting documentation, and identifiable references can help avoid
    unnecessary delays. Incomplete, vague, or unsupported requests may not
    provide enough information for meaningful consideration.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Rights Holder Communication
  </h2>

  <p>
    Copyright owners, authorized representatives, legal professionals,
    organizations, and other appropriate parties may contact TotalSportek
    with questions concerning intellectual property or material referenced
    on the website. Including the relevant details and supporting records
    can help TotalSportek understand the nature of the request and determine
    the appropriate next step.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Ownership Remains With the Rights Holder
  </h2>

  <p>
    This policy does not transfer or alter ownership of intellectual property
    belonging to third parties. Copyrights, trademarks, service marks,
    logos, names, designs, and other protected rights continue to belong to
    their respective owners. The appearance of a third-party name, mark,
    or reference within TotalSportek sports information does not by itself
    establish ownership or an official connection with TotalSportek.
  </p>
</div>

</div>
  </body>
</html>